        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CIRCIR-DB, Classic Circulaire Door Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Circulaire Deadbolt has a traditional style that is great for almost any home. Easy to install, it fits doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and it is available with either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. The Classic Circulaire Deadbolt is available in many traditional finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and timeless bronze. Choose from either a single cylinder (keyed lock on the outside with thumb turn inside) or a double cylinder (keyed lock on both outside and inside) function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur CIRCIR-DB Circulaire Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Traditional Circulaire Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-deadbolt.pdf?v=1704262180\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur Deadbolt Exploded View (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CIRCIRDB-specifications.pdf?v=1704262326\" target=\"new\"><b>Circulaire Deadbolt Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Circulaire Deadbolt | Classic Circulaire Deadbolt",
                "description": "Grandeur CIRCIR-DB Circulaire Deadbolt - The Circulaire Deadbolt has a traditional style that is great for almost any home. Easy to install, it fits doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick and it is available with either a 2-3/8 inch or a 2-3/4 inch backset. The Classic Circulaire Deadbolt is available in many traditional finishes including polished brass, satin nickel, and timeless bronze. Choose from either a single cylinder (keyed lock on the outside with thumb turn inside) or a double cylinder (keyed lock on both outside and inside) function.",
